{"id": "60133", "title": "老玩物", "author": "葡萄柚绿茶", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/60/60133.htm", "intro": "(SM向，血腥，不适者勿入)\r\n\r\n属性分类：现代／特殊职业／一般言情／正剧\r\n\r\n关键字：秋叶 　 \r\n\r\n文案： \r\n\r\n春色如花，又怎敌那青春洋溢轻轻一笑。\r\n\r\n十五年前，仰望著那人欢快愉悦的灿烂大笑。不仅迷了秋叶的眼，更令她从此耽溺在一个名为『韩睿明』的梦，长醉不醒…\r\n\r\n世间多苦，世界多孤，求而不得，得而不净，在欲与爱的交缠\r\n\r\n谁说相爱最美，真情无价？", "base": "files/article/html/60/60133", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "8813770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-13", "file": "8813772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-20", "file": "8813774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "8813775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "8813776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8813778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8813780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "8813783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "8813785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "8813786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-58", "file": "8813790.html", "available": false}]}